  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.226,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And in that day, seven women shall take hold of one man, saying:",
      "verse": "14:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 4.406,
      "end": 7.75,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "We will eat our own bread, and wear our own apparel;",
      "verse": "14:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.93,
      "end": 11.877,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "only let us be called by thy name to take away our reproach.",
      "verse": "14:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 12.557,
      "end": 16.644,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "In that day shall the branch of the Lord be beautiful and glorious;",
      "verse": "14:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 16.824,
      "end": 19.471,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the fruit of the earth excellent and comely",
      "verse": "14:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 19.651,
      "end": 22.112,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to them that are escaped of Israel.",
      "verse": "14:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 22.792,
      "end": 26.229,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass, they that are left in Zion",
      "verse": "14:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 26.409,
      "end": 29.335,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and remain in Jerusalem shall be called holy,",
      "verse": "14:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 29.515,
      "end": 33.044,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every one that is written among the living in Jerusalem\u2014",
      "verse": "14:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 33.724,
      "end": 37.996,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "When the Lord shall have washed away the filth of the daughters of Zion,",
      "verse": "14:4",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 38.176,
      "end": 45.235,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall have purged the blood of Jerusalem from the midst thereof by the spirit of judgment",
      "verse": "14:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 45.415,
      "end": 47.319,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and by the spirit of burning.",
      "verse": "14:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 47.999,
      "end": 52.271,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lord will create upon every dwelling-place of mount Zion,",
      "verse": "14:5",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 52.451,
      "end": 54.169,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and upon her assemblies,",
      "verse": "14:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 54.349,
      "end": 56.114,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a cloud and smoke by day",
      "verse": "14:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 56.294,
      "end": 59.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the shining of a flaming fire by night;",
      "verse": "14:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 59.4,
      "end": 62.837,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for upon all the glory of Zion shall be a defence.",
      "verse": "14:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 63.517,
      "end": 65.607,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there shall be a tabernacle",
      "verse": "14:6",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 65.787,
      "end": 68.945,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for a shadow in the daytime from the heat,",
      "verse": "14:6",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 69.125,
      "end": 70.983,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and for a place of refuge,",
      "verse": "14:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 71.163,
      "end": 73.81,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and a covert from storm and from rain.",
      "verse": "14:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    }
  ]
}